---

<section id="advantage" class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-[#F8FAFC] border-b border-slate-200/80">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-16 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <span class="text-[#2563EB] text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 block">
        Why Hill Stack Studio
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#0B0F19] tracking-tight mb-6">
        Our Audit Is Your Advantage
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        See how our modern optimized websites stack up against template website agency builds.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xl overflow-hidden">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 divide-y md:divide-y-0 md:divide-x divide-slate-200">
        {/* Standard Agency Column */}
        <div class="p-8 sm:p-10 bg-slate-50/50">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-8">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-red-100 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-base shrink-0">
              ✕
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-800">Standard Template Websites</h3>
          </div>
          <ul class="space-y-6">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3.5 text-slate-600 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
              <span class="text-red-500 font-bold mt-0.5 shrink-0">✕</span>
              <span>Slow loading pages that turn away potential customers</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3.5 text-slate-600 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
              <span class="text-red-500 font-bold mt-0.5 shrink-0">✕</span>
              <span>Built for Google search and hidden from AI search engines</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3.5 text-slate-600 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
              <span class="text-red-500 font-bold mt-0.5 shrink-0">✕</span>
              <span>Cluttered mobile layouts that make it difficult to navigate to your contact information</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3.5 text-slate-600 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
              <span class="text-red-500 font-bold mt-0.5 shrink-0">✕</span>
              <span>Surprise maintenance fees, constant plugin &amp; security updates that break your site</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        {/* Hill Stack AI-Optimized Column */}
        <div class="p-8 sm:p-10 bg-white relative">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-8">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-base shadow-sm shrink-0">
              ✓
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-[#0B0F19]">Hill Stack Optimized Websites</h3>
          </div>
          <ul class="space-y-6">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3.5 text-[#0B0F19] font-medium text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
              <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold mt-0.5 shrink-0">✓</span>
              <span><strong>Built for instant page loads and visitor conversion</strong></span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3.5 text-[#0B0F19] font-medium text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
              <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold mt-0.5 shrink-0">✓</span>
              <span><strong>Recommended by Google &amp; Discoverable by AI search engines (ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude)</strong></span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3.5 text-[#0B0F19] font-medium text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
              <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold mt-0.5 shrink-0">✓</span>
              <span><strong>Clean responsive layouts across Desktop, Tablet &amp; Mobile</strong></span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3.5 text-[#0B0F19] font-medium text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
              <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold mt-0.5 shrink-0">✓</span>
              <span><strong>Website hosting & administration, no surprise fees or updates</strong></span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
